          ],
          "content": "1. On which item does Imran’s family spend the most and the second most?"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.143,
            0.198,
            0.831,
            0.22
          ],
          "content": "2. Is the cost of electricity about one-half the cost of education?"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.143,
            0.228,
            0.831,
            0.249
          ],
          "content": "3. Is the cost of education less than one-fourth the cost of food?"
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph_title",
          "bbox": [
            0.115,
            0.268,
            0.302,
            0.29
          ],
          "level": 2,
          "content": "Figure it Out"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.143,
            0.301,
            0.834,
            0.345
          ],
          "content": "1. Samantha visited a tea garden, and collected data of the insects and critters she saw there. Here is the data she collected:"
